# Keeps `gcloud builds submit` from uploading 837MB of local state.
#
# Without this the build context is the whole package directory: .venv alone is
# 798MB and artifacts/ another 38MB, none of which the image needs — the
# Dockerfile installs dependencies from pyproject.toml and uv.lock inside the
# container.
.venv/
artifacts/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.env
.git/
tests/
